<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-Centennial Coal says won't raise bid.</title>
<headline>RTRS-Centennial Coal says won't raise bid.</headline>
<dateline>BRISBANE 1996-10-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Centennial Coal Company Ltd said on Monday it would not increase its bid for Allied Queensland Coalfields Ltd (AQC) beyond the 75 cents cash presently being offered for for each AQC ordinary share.</p>
<p>&quot;The Centennial Board has an obligation to invest shareholders' money wisely. Centennial believes that at 75 cents AQC is fully priced,&quot; managing director Bob Cameron said in a statement.</p>
</text>
